  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Right triangles <math alttext=\"upper L upper M upper N\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>L</mi>\n\t<mi>M</mi>\n\t<mi>N</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"upper P upper Q upper R\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>P</mi>\n\t<mi>Q</mi>\n\t<mi>R</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> are similar, where <math alttext=\"upper L\"><mi>L</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"upper M\"><mi>M</mi>\n</math> correspond to <math alttext=\"upper P\"><mi>P</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"upper Q\"><mi>Q</mi>\n</math>, respectively. Angle <math alttext=\"upper M\"><mi>M</mi>\n</math> has a measure of <math alttext=\"53 degree\"><mn>53</mn>\n<mo>&#176;</mo></math>. What is the measure of angle <math alttext=\"upper Q\"><mi>Q</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
